{"zw/i+on": {"key": "zw/i+on", "head": "ζώϊον", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζώϊον</b>, <span class=\"lsj-gen\">τό</span>, poet. for <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷον,</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Semon.</span> 13</span>."}, "zw=|on": {"key": "zw=|on", "head": "ζῷον", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζῷον</b>, <span class=\"lsj-gen\">τό</span>, <div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>living being, animal,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 5.10</span> (of bees), <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Ar.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">V.</i> 551</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Pl.</i> 443</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">πᾶν ὅ τι περ ἂν μετάσχῃ τοῦ ζῆν ζῷον ἂν λέγοιτο</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ti.</i> 77b</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷα,</span> opp. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">φυτά,</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Phd.</i> 70d</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">110e</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζ. θαλάττιον, χερσαῖον,</span> <span class=\"lsj-author\">Phld.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Rh.</i> 1.98S.; contemptuously, <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ὅπως ἡ χώρα τοῦ τοιούτου ζῴου καθαρὰ γίγνηται</span> may be free from this kind of <i>animal</i> (i.e. beggars), <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Lg.</i> 936c</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζ. πονηρόν,</span> of women, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Secund.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Sent.</i> 8</span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">II.</b>  in art, <i>figure, image,</i> not necessarily of animals (cf. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῴδιον</span>) , <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζῷον δέ οἱ ἐνῆν, ἀνὴρ ἱππεύς</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 3.88</span></span>: mostly in pl., <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζῷα ἐς τὴν ἐσθῆτα ἐγγράφειν</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> 1.203</span></span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">2.4</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">124</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">148</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">R.</i> 515a</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷα γράψασθαι τὴν ζεῦξιν τοῦ Βοσπόρου</span> to have <i>pictures</i> of the bridging of the Bosporus painted, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 4.88</span>; cf. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζωγραφέω</span>: <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζῷα ποιεῖν</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Plu.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Per.</i> 13</span></span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">III.</b>  <i>sign</i> of the Zodiac, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Man.</span> 2.166</span>.—The word is post-<span class=\"lsj-author\">Hom.</span>, no generic word used for <i>animal</i> being found till after the middle of the fifth cent. B.C. (<span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζώϊον</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Semon.</span> 13</span></span>, whence <span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Att.</span></span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷον</span> by contraction: <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ι</span> is found in <i class=\"lsj-title\">IG</i> 1(2).372.42, al.,11(2).161<i class=\"lsj-title\">B</i> 76 (<span class=\"lsj-placeName\">Delos</span>, <span class=\"lsj-date\">iii B.C.</span>), <span class=\"lsj-author\">Phld.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Rh.</i> 2.166S., and in codd. opt. in the Noun; the <span class=\"lsj-pos\">Adj.</span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζωός</span> (q.v.) had no <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ι</span>: for the compds. (exc. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζωγλύφος, ζωγράφος</span>) decisive evidence is lacking: <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῳάγρια</span> with <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ι</span> was read by <span class=\"lsj-author\">Aristarch.</span> in <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 18.407</span>.)</div>"}, "zw|o/w": {"key": "zw|o/w", "head": "ζῳόω", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζῳόω</b>, <div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>fashion into an animal,</i> <span class=\"lsj-tns\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lsj-mood\">inf.</span> <span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Pass.</span></span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἐζῳῶσθαι</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Alex.Aphr.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">in Top.</i> 137.26</span></span>.</div>"}}